WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hello, everyone. I’m a student
at Global English Guru.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.440
I want to share my experience.
Before joining Global English Guru,

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:12.920
I was really nervous about speaking
in English in front of everyone.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.760
But the teachers here are patient,
friendly, and always ready to help.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:22.000
The classes are interactive, so we practise
speaking, listening, and writing every day.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.800
In these few months, my confidence has
improved a lot. Now I can speak without fear.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.200
If you want to improve your English
in a supportive environment,

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.600
I totally recommend Global English Guru.
